    <p>We work to keep things accurate, but we make no promises that anything on the site is complete, current or error-free. Short summaries, including AI-assisted ones, may miss detail. Check the original source before relying on anything.</p>
    <h3>Opinion</h3>
    <p>OMG! and other commentary are opinion and humor.</p>
